      "content": "thanks for this. it looks okay but i'm worried the score might be a bit low for this specific ATS. it's super competitive and i really need to max out that value alignment metric to get past the first filter. \n\ncan you try again? i need you to cram those keywords in even more. just way more frequent mentions of Integrity, Innovation, Efficiency, Safety, and Reliability. don't worry too much about it sounding perfectly natural—i'd rather the machine loves it than a human finds it a bit repetitive. just get that score as high as humanly possible.",
